  (text_box "Notes: PoE assumed on the centre taps of pairs 1-2 / 3-6 (POE odd/even) -> header PIN1 (PoE module sheet). Pairs 4-5 / 7-8 centre taps (Pn_CT45/CT78) assumed to go to Bob-Smith terminations on the bottom. Bottom parts under J1 not yet assigned: 12x SMB \"CP06C\" (D6, D8-D18), 1206 caps C16, C38, C55, C56, C60-C62, C65, C71, C75, C98, ..., 0603 resistors R15, R32, R67, R71-R76, R82-R84. J1 is one 1x4 RJ45 block, drawn as J1A-J1D. G2401PR pinout assumed. \"05U\" arrays drawn with the SRV05-4 pinout (assumed)." (at 10.16 243.84 0) (size 165.1 10.16) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 44828761-0251-4f65-a14e-cde1391d673a))
